@startuml
!include style.iuml
title AD-7: Blocker Reporting and Handling (WF-13)
|Reporter|
start
:Select task and describe blocker;
|System|
:Create blocker record;
if (Reporter is the assignee?) then (yes)
  :Set task status Blocked;
else (no)
endif
:Notify Team Leader;
|AI Supervisor|
:Identify affected dependent tasks;
:Recommend action;
|Team Leader|
:Review blocker;
if (Action?) then (resolve)
  :Resolve blocker;
elseif (Reassign task or adjust dependency or deadline) then
  :Apply change;
else (escalate)
  :Escalate to Supervisor;
endif
|System|
:Record resolution and close blocker;
:Return task to In Progress;
stop
@enduml
